I am finally at the door.
I turn the key.
The door is open.
I go into the flat.
It is dark.
I press the switch.
The light is on.
I am very tired, but relieved.
I put the suitcase down.
I look into the room.
What is there here?
Here is a bed.
There is a table.
There is also a chair and a lamp.
And there is a tall window.
Everything is very quiet.
I am finally in Berlin.
This is my new home.
